# The Underground bags and a captured secret base, through the game's
# own setters.
#
# These are what a vendor, a finished dig and a successful Digger Drill
# leave in the save. A station that wanted them by playing those out
# would need the comm loopback and a few thousand extra frames; this
# writes the same slots those paths write, so the reader can see them.

name STOWER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20482
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
sphere SPHERE_PRISM 12
sphere SPHERE_RED 4
trap TRAP_SMOKE
trap TRAP_DIGGER_DRILL
good UG_GOOD_TV
good UG_GOOD_WOODEN_CHAIR
good-pc UG_GOOD_FEATHERY_BED
secret-base 72 437 FACE_UP
map MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY 0x12F 0x2F5 FACE_DOWN
